WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.550
Lab 1 needs PowerShell 7 with
Pester, working in the kit's folder.

2
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:09.638
The lab settings name a fictional
tenant in GCC; nothing signs in.

3
00:00:09.638 --> 00:00:12.474
Step 1 lists what Microsoft 365 needs:

4
00:00:12.474 --> 00:00:17.049
two permissions across three
calls, and nothing that writes.

5
00:00:17.049 --> 00:00:22.094
Step 2 prints each cloud's Graph
host: GCC on the worldwide host

6
00:00:22.094 --> 00:00:27.138
with the Global environment, then
GCC High and DoD on their own.

7
00:00:27.138 --> 00:00:29.775
There's one row per cloud and no default.

8
00:00:29.775 --> 00:00:35.153
Step 3 collects Microsoft 365 from
the day-one fixtures: six notices,

9
00:00:35.153 --> 00:00:39.820
five open, two needing action,
all valid against the schema.
